; One diagnostic, on the misspelling. The other two lines take one branch
; each and are clean. `MAX_BONE` is a well-formed symbol, so it would have
; satisfied the default `symbol` ref half; with `:ref define-ref` it has to
; name a real `(define …)` and does not — and because a symbol can only
; have meant the reference arm, the code is that arm's `not_cross_ref`.
(diagnostics
  (diagnostic :code not_cross_ref :path [mesh bones]))
